@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Liste lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/medications
X-Correlation-ID: manual-list

### Einzelnen Datensatz lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/medications/1

### Gültigen Datensatz anlegen (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/medications
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-create

{
  "pzn": "00999999",
  "productName": "Testpräparat",
  "activeIngredient": "Teststoff",
  "dosageForm": "Tablette",
  "prescriptionRequired": true,
  "active": true
}

### Ungültigen Datensatz ablehnen (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/medications
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-validation

{}

### Vorhandenen fachlichen Schlüssel ablehnen (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/medications
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-conflict

{
  "pzn": "09231122",
  "productName": "Testpräparat",
  "activeIngredient": "Teststoff",
  "dosageForm": "Tablette",
  "prescriptionRequired": true,
  "active": true
}

### Seed-Datensatz mit unverändertem Schlüssel ersetzen (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/medications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pzn": "09231122",
  "productName": "Testpräparat aktualisiert",
  "activeIngredient": "Teststoff",
  "dosageForm": "Tablette",
  "prescriptionRequired": true,
  "active": true
}

### Unbekannten Datensatz idempotent löschen (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/medications/999999
